<title>HUNGARY: Hungary October central bank reserves $10.1 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary October central bank reserves $10.1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary's reserves stood at $10.1 billion at the end of October, down from $10.4 billion at the end of September, the bank said in a statement on Monday. No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
